.TH QZIP 1 "September 2026" "Qore ZIP module" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
qzip \- create, inspect, extract and modify ZIP archives
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qzip
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Qore ZIP archive utility. Commands include create, extract, list, add, info,
verify, diff, recompress, add-path, delete and replace.
Use qzip COMMAND --help for command-specific arguments and options.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -h , " --help"
Display usage.
.TP
.BR -C , " --no-color"
Disable colored output.
.TP
.BR -p , " --password=" value
Password for encryption or decryption. Command-line arguments can be visible
in process listings; use the Qore API when a protected secret input is required.
.TP
.BR -e , " --encryption=" method
For creation or recompression, select pkware, aes-128, aes-192 or aes-256.
PKWARE is the compatibility default; AES-256 provides stronger encryption.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
qzip create output.zip report.txt
qzip list output.zip
qzip extract --dest output output.zip
qzip verify output.zip
.fi
